        <h3>Kitchens tailored to La Lagunita</h3>
        <p>La Lagunita is a residential neighborhood of single-family homes on large lots, many with gardens and pools. Properties range from 250 to 700 m², built between the 70s and the 2000s. La Lagunita homes frequently have pools, gardens and service areas that need waterproofing and exterior renewal alongside the interior remodel.</p>
